# Rimefire Torque: "As this artifact enters, choose a creature type. Whenever a permanent you control of the chosen type
# enters, put a charge counter on this artifact." Thopter is chosen. Bot1's two Ornithopters (turn 1) make two counters and
# its Mox Ruby, an artifact but no Thopter, makes none; Bot2's Ornithopter (turn 2) is not "you control", so it makes none
# either. A third Ornithopter on turn 3 makes three.
# "{T}, Remove three charge counters: When you next cast an instant or sorcery spell this turn, copy it. You may choose new
# targets for the copy." Paying takes exactly three (none left) and taps the Torque; Bot1's Lightning Bolt at Bot2 is copied
